    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35962" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνόριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>within the boundaries,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.8
			</span></i>; <i>on the boundaries,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					10.1
				</span></i>
			: Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνορία, ἡ,</span>
			<i>territory</i> of a city, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλις καὶ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					1101.5
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cod.Just.</u>
				1.2.25.1
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
